  m_Name: Note_TrophyCasePadlock
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Trophy Case
  author:
  body: 'Heard someone''s been eyeing the trophies in the case again. Not sure

    who''d actually want those old things, but management wants it locked up

    now anyway.


    Set it to 1234, real original I know, but nobody around here''s

    going to guess it.


    Also stuffed some ammo in there while I was at it, since

    management''s been talking about banning weaponry on site. Figured better

    safe than sorry.'
  noteType: 2
